<name>Fuel Suction Tube Assembly (w/ Pump &amp; Gauge) (2GR-FE)</name>
<para id="RM000002AB4005X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="081B4-00" from="200708">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000002AB4005X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000002AB4005X_03_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HGH00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Fuel Pump</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A091823" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(-) - (+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Fuel Pump</ptxt>
<ptxt>Temperature 20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.2 to 3.0 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Operation Check</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Apply battery voltage between the terminals and check that the motor rotates.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the inspection in a short time (10 seconds or less).</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Keep the pump as far away from the battery as possible.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Always perform the switching at the battery terminal side.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
